## Context
Child of 1830. Per source (OpenAlex source id, ISSN), deterministic, provenance of each flag. Rank A (peer-reviewed), B (recognised WP series and institutional reports, including Southern think tanks; versioned list), C (the rest). Hard registers only: Norwegian register (Kanalregisteret) level X via its open API, Scopus "discontinued" for publication reasons, DOAJ removals, known hijacked journals; each extraction dated. Publisher flag for MDPI, Frontiers, Hindawi (kept). Not Beall's list.

## Exit criteria
